+        {config.recognition.threshold < RECOMMENDED_THRESHOLD
+          ? `Below ${RECOMMENDED_THRESHOLD * 100}% a stranger matches far more often (about 4% of strangers over 5 scans at 50%, 0.3% at 60%).`
+          : `If your own face scores close to it, add more faces rather than lowering it: Test shows the scores.`}
